#: 077da4289d684184bdefbc1218ab77e0
msgid ""
"Joint-position controller (`basic_joint_controller/BasicJointController`)"
" with a three-state FSM (HOME / HOLD / MOVEJ). Optional 灵巧手 "
"switch/percent control and optional waist lifting/turning."
